#. y1:english="Hello, Kazuma-san.\nI'm in the monitor room right now and||happened to notice that you're in trouble.\n\nThere aren't any legitimate hospitals||in this area.\nI do happen to know a good doctor.\n\nYes. Well, his work environment||isn't exactly the cleanest...\nBut he is definitely skilled.\n...His name is Dr. Enomoto.\nHe's got a discreetly located clinic||around where you're at right now.\nIf you prefer a more legitimate place,||this isn't the place for you though...\n\nHe's in a building on W. Taihei Blvd.||On the third floor."
