#. y1:english="Hmm. You again...\nSome things you may not be aware of||are as follows... maybe.\nIs there anything else you want to know?\nTell me about shifting.\nIf you move by the {CU:ffff00}left analog stick{CU:ffffff} while||holding the {CU:ffff00}R1{CU:ffffff} button, you can \"shift\".\nOne drawback is that you can't run,\nbut you can move toward any direction||while always facing the enemy.\nIt's quite useful during a one on one fight||or when you want to make\nconcentrated attacks on an enemy.||Give it a try.\nTell me about guarding.\nGuard by pressing the{CU:ffff00} L1{CU:ffffff} button.\nWhen you're fighting an unarmed enemy,||as long as you make sure you don't get hit\nfrom behind, you can block||the enemy's attack almost perfectly.\nHowever, if the enemy's armed, stay alert.||A blow from a weapon will break your guard.\nAlso, guarding is useless against||knives or guns, obviously.\nTell me about dodging.\nYou can dodge by pressing {IC:00_03}➿ while shifting.\nBy using this technique, you can avoid||the enemy's attack\nor position yourself behind the enemy.\nBy improving your \"TAI\" skills,||you will be able to move faster.\nWho the hell are you?\nMy name's Oki. I'm an apprentice of a grand||master of martial arts, Sotaro Komaki.\nI see... {PA:10}If you want to||know something, feel free to ask me."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0003.BIN:83_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0003.BIN::line:83_0_0"
msgid "Umm. De nuevo tú..."
msgstr ""

